WEBVTT

00:22:29.496 --> 00:22:32.413
and it just it had completely changed.

00:22:32.746 --> 00:22:33.996
You know, you go to college,

00:22:34.496 --> 00:22:37.329
you spend all this money and you
think when you come out,

00:22:37.788 --> 00:22:41.663
I'm going to have some options. And then
that historical moment, I really didn't.

00:22:41.704 --> 00:22:45.954
That was true for many, many other
people graduating in that time

00:22:45.954 --> 00:22:48.079
and certainly true for many people
graduating right now.

00:22:49.079 --> 00:22:52.788
Emily knows it's true now because
she studied it as

00:22:52.788 --> 00:22:55.454
an organizational behavior professor
at Emory University.

00:22:55.746 --> 00:22:59.496
Emily is one of the world's foremost
experts on the psychology of recessions.

00:22:59.996 --> 00:23:04.413
Do you ever have these horrible moments,
given what you study where you say,